        "ru-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "8585b115-9674-3ecb-9e42-67f39c29e438",
                "word": "мгновенно",
                "pos": "adv",
                "lang_code": "ru",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "a6fff72c-79b0-331f-b612-4b2c8261cd4f",
                        "entry_id": "8585b115-9674-3ecb-9e42-67f39c29e438",
                        "glosses": [
                            "внезапно (возникать, наступать)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "2234245b-9a29-409a-bcac-240ef4b6c8dd",
                                "sense_id": "a6fff72c-79b0-331f-b612-4b2c8261cd4f",
                                "text": "Молодой человек перебрал лишнего, потерял равновесие и ударился головой об угол тротуара. Смерть наступила мгновенно. Вмятина на черепной коробке точно соответствовала профилю ребра бордюрного камня."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "54963ec1-eeae-4b87-8b5a-0fe8fa0bbabc",
                                "sense_id": "a6fff72c-79b0-331f-b612-4b2c8261cd4f",
                                "text": "Пока корвет встал на якорь вблизи города, невдалеке от нескольких купеческих судов, преимущественно пузатых и неуклюжих «китобоев», стоявших на рейде, лиловатые тени сумерек пронеслись, словно дымки, над островом, и вслед затем почти мгновенно наступила ночь."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "7574809a-0723-35c8-a168-65aa9a303c32",
                        "entry_id": "8585b115-9674-3ecb-9e42-67f39c29e438",
                        "glosses": [
                            "быстро (проходить)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a7c465f1-4cfa-4b22-bed1-3e6b1841cbde",
                                "sense_id": "7574809a-0723-35c8-a168-65aa9a303c32",
                                "text": "Мгновенно скрывшись меж кустов, // Невольным трепетом объят, // Я поднял боязливый взгляд, // И жадно вслушиваться стал."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9f20f4fe-f2ea-4c4b-87b1-b559c496f593",
                                "sense_id": "7574809a-0723-35c8-a168-65aa9a303c32",
                                "text": "Это увещание, подкреплённое штыками нескольких солдат, подействовало мгновенно ― кто был поробче ― давай бог ноги, кто посмелее ― прикусил язык."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5204ab66-bf00-37bc-a7b4-e2e89ffe1ca4",
                        "entry_id": "8585b115-9674-3ecb-9e42-67f39c29e438",
                        "glosses": [
                            "предик. оценочная характеристика какого-либо состояния как кратковременного"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "6c2278a2-5f47-47e3-ae3f-74cbe508f49f",
                        "source_entry_id": "8585b115-9674-3ecb-9e42-67f39c29e438",
                        "target_lang_word": "momentarily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "momentarily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "35bd044b-0d3a-350e-89a3-6d058ff57900",
                                        "entry_id": "7ec917b4-5a6f-316e-a7ec-5f897804bef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a momentary manner; for a moment or instant."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "81c9a1d9-beaa-4f6b-9a56-d69b36c1a792",
                                                "sense_id": "35bd044b-0d3a-350e-89a3-6d058ff57900",
                                                "text": "I imagined momentarily that it was four score and seven years ago, that I had just been brought forth from my mother[…]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f10d2760-7949-4d58-9887-abaf8c2d01f6",
                                                "sense_id": "35bd044b-0d3a-350e-89a3-6d058ff57900",
                                                "text": "The numbers thin out the further we get from London, so I don't feel guilty when I remove my mask momentarily to scoff some of the snacks I'd bought at Marylebone."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "cf257a63-22ff-3217-bb23-8b41d292d6a6",
                                        "entry_id": "7ec917b4-5a6f-316e-a7ec-5f897804bef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a moment or very soon; any minute now, any time now."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "US",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "proscribed"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2b256458-4a4d-4c4c-97dc-993a3ff92442",
                                                "sense_id": "cf257a63-22ff-3217-bb23-8b41d292d6a6",
                                                "text": "The system will restart momentarily."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "939d3a26-ac2b-4eec-8207-3d397c1bf94f",
                                                "sense_id": "cf257a63-22ff-3217-bb23-8b41d292d6a6",
                                                "text": "He told me, further, that the second coming was at hand--was looked for momentarily in Jerusalem."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b30611a6-ea1a-30bc-addb-b4844b6f5839",
                                        "entry_id": "7ec917b4-5a6f-316e-a7ec-5f897804bef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Progressively; moment by moment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0371a13d-1e8a-4535-9d55-af4d7cde7890",
                        "source_entry_id": "8585b115-9674-3ecb-9e42-67f39c29e438",
                        "target_lang_word": "instantaneously",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "instantaneously",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5b27193f-a023-3ed5-aee4-3783b68d5222",
                                        "entry_id": "f1a5bdec-b614-3826-ac72-1193e2ba0426",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Without any delay; in an instantaneous manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "not-comparable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2fe191a4-9310-4d61-942f-ebffdd229904",
                                                "sense_id": "5b27193f-a023-3ed5-aee4-3783b68d5222",
                                                "text": "How quick the eye and hand to catch him [the ruffed grouse] when he rises from the underbrush and is out of sight in the wood before the untrained sportsman stops him with what is little more than a snapshot, so instantaneously must all be done!"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf59eff2-2950-4f4a-8741-c2d9c7d60430",
                                                "sense_id": "5b27193f-a023-3ed5-aee4-3783b68d5222",
                                                "text": "Under the guise of being “online” and capable of disseminating news instantaneously (known colloquially as “retweeting”), being active on Twitter, for media workers, gives the effect of fulfilling one’s occupational duty as well as all the parts of professional upkeep that, in the physical world, involve being in the right rooms, overhearing the right things, and more or less maintaining appearances."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
